<!--
    Competition injuries, written in Realistic Livestock's own disease format (its xml/diseases.xml)
    and added to its disease registry, so an injured horse shows the injury on its Diseases page,
    where the player can start treatment, leave it to heal, or cull. EqInjury.lua loads this file.

    What every injury has in common, and why:
        archetype="management" r0="0"   not an infection: nothing spreads to other horses
        <infection> perMonth="0"         RLRM never hands one out on its own; only an event does
        caseFatality="0"                 an injury never kills
        incubationTicks="0"              it shows the day it happens
        recoveryChancePerMonth="1"       untreated, it heals exactly when durationMonths is up
        immunityMonths="0"               the healed record is cleared the next day
        <treatment outcome="cure">       a course heals it after `months`, billed `cost` a month
                                         (Retiring the horse cuts that fee: EqInjury.RETIRED_FEE_SHARE)

    The per-injury numbers:
        durationMonths      months of rest it takes to heal untreated
        treatment months    months a course takes: RLRM wants a whole number, at least 1
        treatment cost      the vet's fee per month while a course runs
        treatment days      ours, not RLRM's: a one-day course instead (whatever the days per
                            month), and cost is then the flat fee for it. months stays 1 so
                            RLRM accepts the block; EqInjury shortens the course when it runs.
        salePrice           what the horse is worth while injured (RLRM won't sell it anyway)

    How often each one happens, and whether it can end a career, is in data/events.xml <risk>;
    every name there needs a disease here titled "eqInjury" + the name with a capital first letter.
    The display names are the rl_disease_<title> texts in our translations.
-->
<diseases>

	<disease title="eqInjuryBruisedSole" animals="HORSE">
		<model archetype="management" endpoint="recovers" cullRequired="false"
			incubationTicks="0" r0="0" durationMonths="1" recoveryChancePerMonth="1"
			caseFatality="0" immunityMonths="0" salePrice="0.9">
			<infection><key ageMonths="0" perMonth="0"/></infection>
			<treatment months="1" days="1" cost="400" efficacy="1" outcome="cure"/>
			<effects weightGain="1" fertility="1"/>
		</model>
	</disease>

